        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuheeli bwOMWAMI khuYakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusiiko omusitohu kwOMWAMI khuIsiraeli, mumunwa kwaMalaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI aboola mbu Ndamuheelile. Neenyu mureebanga mbu Ne okhuheelile orie? OMWAMI aboola mbu Esau shiyali omwana wabwe Yakobo? Ne ndamuheelile Yakobo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula Esau ndamuchwang'ile, ningwisia ebikulubie likunda, nindeshela amabwe akomushitsiimi obulaamebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata abaEdomu nibasunga mbu Khukhupilwe hasi, ne khulakalukha nikhuumbakha mumakunda; ne khane OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola mbu Boombashe, nebutswa isie ndalalikulula; mana abandu balabalanganga mbu Olukongo olubii, khandi mbu Oluyia olwa OMWAMI asinyishila inziayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neenyu, tsimoni tsieenywe tsilalola, mana mulasunga mbu OMWAMI nomukhongo, okhuyomba olwakho lwaIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI yakondeshela abakuhani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana aheelesia samwana oluyali, nomusumba omwamiwe; kho isie nimba nindi seenywe, oluyali lwanje luli heena? Kata nimba nindi omwami, okhuriibwa khwanje khuli heena? Nilwo olwa OMWAMI omwene mahe amureeba, inywe abakuhani abaleka eliira lianje. Neenyu mureebanga mbu Ne khulechile eliiralio khurie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbu nimuhaananga ebiliibwa biobukaali khushimalilo shianje. Neenyu mureebanga mbu Ne khukhukwisiye owobukaali khurie? Mbu nimupaaranga mbu imeesa yOMWAMI yinyala okhulekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa muhaananga ebibofu khulwa omusango, shibuli obubii? Olwa muhaananga ebilema nebiteshele, shibuli obubii? Obiyilile ouli omukafunawo; alakhuchama? Alakhufuchiilila? Nilwo olwa OMWAMI omwene mahe areeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano chame mwikongoye Nyasaye, akhukoosie obukoosia; bino olwa birulanga mumakhono keenywe, alafuchiilila omundu yesi khwinywe? Nilwo olwa OMWAMI omwene mahe areeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiakhuha wabaho mwinywe omundu mulala owakheekala emiliango, mbu muleshe okhuhambia omulilo khushimalilo shianje khulwa butswa! OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola mbu Shimunjamisia ta, kata shindalafuchiilila eshihaanwa eshirula mumakhono keenywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba okhurula khukhufwinda khweliuba okhuula khukhuyeela khwalio, eliira lianje nelikhongo mubanamahanga; buli handu hosi amalesi kelibuuliesi kahaanilungwa khuliira lianje, nende eshihaanwa eshieleleshe; okhuba eliira lianje nelikhongo mubanamahanga; nilwo olwa OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa inywe mulionooninjia nimuboola mbu Imeesa yOMWAMI neyobukaaii, khandi mbu ebiliibwa ebilikhwo binyala okhulekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola mbu Musunga mbu Kano kanjoonyiye, nimu'fuutsa. Muleeranga eshiatiilwa namahababa, nebilema, nebiteshele, mbu bibe ebihaanwa. Nasi efuchiilile bino mumakhono keenywe? Nilwo olwa OMWAMI areeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abe mushilaamo shiobubii omukaatii oyo ouli nomuruko kweshisaatsa mushiayoshie, nakwahula neshiitsubo, nebutswa amalanga namalila OMWAMI omusango kweshindu eshilema; okhuba OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola mbu Nisie omuruchi omukhongo, ne eliira lianje neliamariisia mubanamahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
